+```powershell
+(Get-FileHash D:\CyberLLM\models\cyberllm-v8\adapter_model.safetensors -Algorithm SHA256).Hash
+# must equal: D624ED793A45A64CB541577441C87C7D2FEB83C37A84DA057D1C15E58E45A5B1
